00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:01.047 line:0%
THERE ARE VERY FEW PEOPLE WHO

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:03.216 line:0%
ARE ACTUALLY FROM KABUL.

00:08:01.714 --> 00:08:06.919 line:0%
THERE ARE PEOPLE WHO, HAVE

00:08:03.382 --> 00:08:09.322 line:0%
SPENT OVER DECADES HERE, AND

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:13.960 line:0%
STILL, ALMOST EVERYONE'S FAMILY

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:16.929 line:0%
COMES FROM SOMEWHERE ELSE.

00:08:14.827 --> 00:08:18.130 line:0%
AND YOU CAN SEE THESE PROVINCES

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:19.265 line:0%
FALLING, BUT ALMOST EVERYWHERE,

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:20.066 line:0%
PROBABLY, HAS SOME CONNECTION

00:08:19.432 --> 00:08:23.069 line:0%
TO ONE OF THOSE.

00:08:21.801 --> 00:08:25.104 line:0%
&gt;&gt; OUR AFGHANS WHO SPEAK WITH

00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:26.138 line:0%
ANGRY ABOUT THE SPEED OF THE

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:28.875 line:0%
WITHDRAWAL OF THE WEST?

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:29.308 line:0%
DO THEY FEEL LET DOWN, OR

00:08:29.041 --> 00:08:30.176 line:0%
ABANDONED?

00:08:29.475 --> 00:08:31.878 line:0%
NOT JUST BY THE WEST, BUT BY

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:33.179 line:0%
THEIR OWN LEADERS, WHO HAVE

00:08:32.044 --> 00:08:34.914 line:0%
OFTEN, OF COURSE, IT ACCUSED OF

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:36.215 line:0%
BEING CORRUPT, OR RUNNING THE

00:08:35.081 --> 00:08:39.886 line:0%
COUNTRY INEPT AWAY?

00:08:36.816 --> 00:08:43.055 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I WAS SPEAKING TO FRIENDS

00:08:40.052 --> 00:08:44.891 line:0%
FROM KANDAHAR LAST NIGHT, AND

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:45.291 line:0%
THAT WAS EXACTLY WHAT THEY WERE

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:48.127 line:0%
SAYING.

00:08:46.659 --> 00:08:49.228 line:0%
THEY WERE FEELING LIKE THERE

00:08:48.294 --> 00:08:50.263 line:0%
WASN'T MUCH OF A FIGHT PUT UP.

00:08:49.395 --> 00:08:51.864 line:0%
THEY FELT THAT THERE WASN'T

00:08:50.429 --> 00:08:52.498 line:0%
MUCH OF AN EFFORT TO PUT INTO

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:56.068 line:0%
DEFENDING THE CITIES.

00:08:52.665 --> 00:08:56.602 line:0%
THAT THE CITY'S FELL TO EASILY,

00:08:56.235 --> 00:08:59.171 line:0%
AND TO QUICKLY.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.873 line:0%
CONSIDERING THEIR SIGNIFICANCE,

00:08:59.338 --> 00:09:02.174 line:0%
THEIR HISTORY, AND TO THE

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:05.144 line:0%
POPULATION, INTO THE ECONOMY OF

00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:10.016 line:0%
THIS COUNTRY.

00:09:07.813 --> 00:09:11.918 line:0%
AND IT IS JUST EXPRESSING SO

00:09:10.182 --> 00:09:12.385 line:0%
MUCH FRUSTRATION AT THE

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:14.220 line:0%
GOVERNMENT.

00:09:12.818 --> 00:09:15.121 line:0%
SO MUCH FOR ITS CORRUPTION, FOR

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.889 line:0%
ITS INABILITY.

00:09:15.288 --> 00:09:19.258 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IS THERE A RISK FOR THE

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:20.893 line:0%
TALIBAN, DOMESTICALLY, BUT

00:09:19.425 --> 00:09:22.328 line:0%
HAVING GOTTEN THEIR CHIEF

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:24.897 line:0%
DEMAND, WHICH IS THE DEPARTURE

00:09:22.828 --> 00:09:25.998 line:0%
OF FOREIGN FORCES, AND THEN

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:27.900 line:0%
CONTINUING THE FIGHT, AND

00:09:26.165 --> 00:09:30.069 line:0%
KILLING FELLOW AFGHANS MIGHT

00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:31.904 line:0%
BACKFIRE ON THE GROUP IN TERMS

00:09:30.236 --> 00:09:32.338 line:0%
OF WHATEVER GRASSROOTS SUPPORT

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:35.174 line:0%
THEY HAD?

00:09:32.672 --> 00:09:36.876 line:0%
THEY AREN'T KILLING WESTERNERS

00:09:35.341 --> 00:09:37.276 line:0%
RIGHT NOW, THEY ARE KILLING

00:09:37.043 --> 00:09:39.345 line:0%
AFGHANS.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.679 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THIS IS EXACTLY WHAT PEOPLE

00:09:39.512 --> 00:09:42.048 line:0%
SAY.

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:45.251 line:0%
THEY'RE FIGHTING AN OCCUPATION,

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:47.053 line:0%
AND THEY'RE GOING TO LEAVE.

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:48.921 line:0%
THEY HAVE BEEN AGREED, AND IT

00:09:47.219 --> 00:09:49.689 line:0%
IS THEIR FORCES, AND THEIR

00:09:49.088 --> 00:09:51.057 line:0%
ADMINISTRATORS, AND EVERYTHING

00:09:49.855 --> 00:09:54.226 line:0%
LIKE THAT.

00:09:52.825 --> 00:09:55.227 line:0%
AND, IN THE WAY THAT THEY HAVE

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:56.896 line:0%
BEEN ACTING, OR THE WAY THEY

00:09:55.394 --> 00:09:59.131 line:0%
HAVE BEEN STORMING THROUGH THE

00:09:57.063 --> 00:10:00.132 line:0%
CITY'S, THEY HAVE ALSO LOST

00:09:59.298 --> 00:10:04.937 line:0%
THEM A LOT OF SUPPORT.

00:10:01.667 --> 00:10:07.907 line:0%
BECAUSE, IF YOU SEE HOW MANY

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:11.210 line:0%
PEOPLE ARE FLEEING THE CITIES,

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:13.879 line:0%
AND IF THEY HAD MET THEM WHEN

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:14.880 line:0%
THEY CAME TO KABUL, WHAT

00:10:14.046 --> 00:10:15.915 line:0%
THEY'LL SAY IS WHEN THEY HEAR

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:17.917 line:0%
THEIR ON THEIR WAY, WE KNOW

00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:19.085 line:0%
THEY ARE COMING IN A DAY OR 2,

00:10:18.084 --> 00:10:19.418 line:0%
AND WE WILL FLEE AS SOON AS WE

00:10:19.251 --> 00:10:22.088 line:0%
CAN.

00:10:19.685 --> 00:10:22.455 line:0%
THERE IS PLENTY OF THOUGHT

00:10:22.254 --> 00:10:24.890 line:0%
HERE.

00:10:22.655 --> 00:10:26.058 line:0%
THERE IS A LOT OF FEAR OF THE

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:29.095 line:0%
FIGHTING THAT COMES WITH IT,

00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:30.062 line:0%
AND IF THEY COME, AND THAT

00:10:29.261 --> 00:10:31.097 line:0%
MEANS THAT THEY WILL BE

00:10:30.229 --> 00:10:33.132 line:0%
FIGHTING WITH THE SECURITY

00:10:31.263 --> 00:10:34.066 line:0%
FORCES, AND THE SECURITY FORCES

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:35.134 line:0%
WILL BE FIGHTING WITH THEM.

00:10:34.233 --> 00:10:37.370 line:0%
WHO IS CAUGHT IN THE CROSS FIRE?

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:39.038 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ALL OVER, THEY ARE KNOCKING

00:10:37.903 --> 00:10:40.039 line:0%
ON THE DOORS, OR THERE WILL BE,

00:10:39.205 --> 00:10:42.174 line:0%
SOON OF KABUL.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:50.082 line:0%
ARE YOU WORRIED, YOURSELF?

00:10:48.848 --> 00:10:52.151 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I AM WORRIED FOR MY PEOPLE.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:55.021 line:0%
I AM WORRIED FOR THE COUNTRY.

00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:55.988 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU ANGRY AT HOW THIS

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:59.058 line:0%
CAME TO BE?

00:10:58.824 --> 00:11:02.962 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:08.167 line:0%
BECAUSE --

00:11:04.697 --> 00:11:08.968 line:0%
BECAUSE I FEEL LIKE EVERYBODY

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:11.037 line:0%
SHARES A RESPONSIBILITY.

00:11:09.802 --> 00:11:12.905 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ALI, THANK YOU SO MUCH,

00:11:11.203 --> 00:11:14.974 line:0%
THINKING OF YOU IN KABUL, AND

00:11:13.072 --> 00:11:16.142 line:0%
EVERYONE ELSE THERE AS WELL.

00:11:15.141 --> 00:11:16.909 line:0%
THEY ARE FOLLOWING YOUR TWITTER,

00:11:16.308 --> 00:11:16.909 line:0%
AND PEOPLE SHO

